{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:776","content":{"id":776,"title":"标题","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"5da20b05-aef7-42a6-a049-be9d64543dba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"支持六级标题，可通过 Markdown 语法（"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"# + 空格"},{"type":"formatted","text":"），也可以通过 Slash 面板创建。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"3177e015-d96a-4d64-af39-d324a5dae45d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用技巧："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"a56aeccb-fc7a-4b33-889a-f6c478bd6369","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"c392350a-dfa5-419c-8702-f51c92070276","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"ae028368-e721-4649-85c6-d5a383428f9b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"支持通过 "},{"type":"kbd","collabId":"25a7ce5d-209f-428f-95c2-2c23b1c09033","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"alt"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" + 上下方向键调整标题层级，最高一级标题，最低是段落，也可以在段落上直接使用此快捷键升级为标题"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"7e0f757a-5453-46ef-9aaf-e0015d864fde","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"4b976fde-bd63-4865-9969-6da1bc727ed0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可通过标题左侧的箭头收起标题范围下的内容，可用于长文档下的整理，以及收起时可显著提升性能，减少编辑时的卡顿"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"79248648-bad3-40ec-ba78-7dadf0e93001","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在支持目录的场景下，会自动根据标题层级自动形成目录，只会考虑在最外部的标题，"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"如果在嵌套块中使用了标题，这种标题无法被识别为目录。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"软件使用文档","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}},{"label":"编辑器","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:736","type":"doc","id":736}},{"label":"标题","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:776","type":"doc","id":776}}],"prevPage":{"title":"Slash 面板","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:777","type":"doc","id":777}},"nextPage":{"title":"图片与图册","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:965","type":"doc","id":965}},"createTime":1767264222922,"updateTime":1792110089614,"projectId":48},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1792110089614}}